{"ticker":{"symbol":"336370.KS","name":"솔루스첨단소재","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":6550.0,"change_pct":-0.007575757575757569,"market_cap":570629423104.0,"pe":214.46082,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.0015267175572519084,"week52_low":5330.0,"week52_high":16900.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","country":"South Korea","city":"Iksan-si","employees":190,"website":"https://www.solusadvancedmaterials.com","business_summary":"Solus Advanced Materials Co., Ltd. provides material solutions in South Korea and internationally. It offers battery copper foil for use in electric vehicle battery; copper foil for use in various electronic equipment; and light-emitting and non-emitting materials for use in organic light emitting diode display, such as smartphones, TVs, vehicles, and tablet/PCs. The company was formerly known as Doosan Solus Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Solus Advanced Materials Co., Ltd. in 2020. Solus Advanced Materials Co., Ltd. was founded in 2019 and is headquartered in Iksan-si, South Korea. Solus Advanced Materials Co. Ltd. is a subsidiary of Skylake Equity Partners Limited.","business_summary_ko":"솔루스첨단소재(주)는 국내는 물론 해외에 소재 솔루션을 제공하고 있습니다. 전기 자동차 배터리에 사용되는 배터리 동박을 제공합니다. 각종 전자 기기에 사용되는 동박; 스마트폰, TV, 자동차, 태블릿/PC 등 유기발광다이오드 디스플레이에 사용되는 발광 및 비발광 소재 등을 포함한다. 이 회사는 이전에 두산솔루스(주)로 알려졌으며 2020년에 솔루스첨단소재(주)로 상호를 변경했습니다. 솔루스첨단소재(주)는 2019년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 익산시에 본사를 두고 있습니다. Solus Advanced Materials Co. Ltd.는 Skylake Equity Partners Limited의 자회사입니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":555600000000.0,"rev_lo":552500000000.0,"rev_hi":558700000000.0,"rev_g":-0.0987,"n":2,"eps":371.26236,"eps_lo":368.0,"eps_hi":374.52472,"eps_g":1.5044},{"period":"2027","rev":696966670000.0,"rev_lo":686500000000.0,"rev_hi":711000000000.0,"rev_g":0.2544,"n":4,"eps":30.54171,"eps_lo":-155.0,"eps_hi":354.0,"eps_g":-0.9177}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"전자부품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":418285694710.0,"operating_income